    """Return whether the current '(' starts a JSON-like value at the top level.

    Parentheses are common in prose around JSON blocks. At the top level, only
    treat them as tuple/grouped-value syntax when they are the first token and
    wrap the remainder of the input. Nested object/array values are unaffected.
